%%
%%   Semantic       | flowchart       | sequenceDiagram  | classDiagram     | stateDiagram
%%   ───────────────┼─────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼─────────────
%%   Data flow      | -->             | ->>              | -->              | --> : data
%%   DI/implements  | -.->            | (N/A)            | <|-- / ..>       | (N/A)
%%   Orchestration  | --> (green)     | ->> : [ORCH]     | --> : delegates  | --> : trigger
%%   Observability  | --> (gray)      | -->> : [OBS]     | ..> : observes   | (N/A)
%%   Error path     | --> (red dash)  | -->> : [ERR]     | (N/A)            | --> : error
%%   Return/resp    | (N/A)           | -->>             | (N/A)            | (N/A)
%%
%% Label prefixes for non-flowchart diagrams (SHOULD use when >10 edges):
%%   [DATA]  — data flow operations
%%   [DI]    — dependency injection / port implementation
%%   [ORCH]  — orchestration / service call
%%   [OBS]   — observability (logging, metrics, tracing)
%%   [ERR]   — error handling / quarantine path

